# Creation mutate overlay

See `_docs/PLAN_create_mutate_embed.md` for invariants.

## Rules

- Mutate opens as a native mount (`mountCreateWorkflow` → `mountMutateWorkflow` in a div). Do not boot `/creations/:id/mutate?embed=1` in an iframe; that HTML document is gone.
- Navigation and post-submit refresh go through `creationEditRuntime.js` (native host callbacks via `createWorkflowHost`).
- Submit in overlay: `navigate: 'none'` on `submitCreationWithPending`, then `refreshAfterSubmit({ creationId })`.
- Navigation: `navigate(href)` (in-overlay), `shellOut(href)` (leave overlay), `requestCloseOverlay()` (Escape).
- Do not add scattered `if (isCreationEditEmbed())` branches for reload/href; extend the runtime if a new intent is needed.
- Nested Escape closes in-page dialogs (e.g. i2v modal) first; overlay dismisses only when none are open.

Run `npm run check:workflow-embed` after edits to embed-capable files.
